<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>M/U-Detailing | Premium Car Care</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    background: #080808;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

header {
    padding: 25px 8%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
}

.logo span {
    color: #aaa;
}

nav a {
    color: #ccc;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-left: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.hero {
    min-height: 580px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #292929 0%, #080808 65%);
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(42px, 9vw, 85px);
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.hero h1 span {
    color: #aaa;
}

.hero p {
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-bottom: 35px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    background: #eee;
    color: #080808;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.button:hover {
    background: #aaa;
}

section {
    padding: 80px 8%;
    text-align: center;
}

.section-title {
    font-size: 34px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.subtitle {
    color: #999;
    margin-bottom: 45px;
}

.services {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
}

.card {
    background: #151515;
    padding: 35px 20px;
    border: 1px solid #303030;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

.card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.card p {
    color: #999;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

.about {
    background: #111;
}

.about p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: auto;
    color: #aaa;
    line-height: 1.9;
    font-size: 16px;
}

.gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 15px;
}

.gallery div {
    min-height: 180px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #303030, #111);
    border: 1px solid #444;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    color: #aaa;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.contact {
    background: #111;
}

.contact p {
    color: #aaa;
    margin: 20px 0;
}

.contact a {
    color: #ddd;
    text-decoration: none;
}

footer {
    padding: 30px 15px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #777;
    border-top: 1px solid #292929;
    font-size: 13px;
}

@media(max-width: 600px) {
    header {
        padding: 20px;
    }

    nav a {
        margin-left: 8px;
        font-size: 11px;
    }

    .hero {
        min-height: 500px;
    }

    section {
        padding: 65px 20px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">M/U<span>-DETAILING</span></div>
    <nav>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
    <h1>MORE THAN<br><span>JUST A CLEAN.</span></h1>
    <p>PREMIUM MOBILE CAR DETAILING</p>
    <a class="button" href="https://wa.me/353892504604">
        BOOK YOUR DETAIL
    </a>
</div>

<section id="services">
    <h2 class="section-title">OUR SERVICES</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Professional care. Exceptional results.</p>

    <div class="services">

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Exterior Detailing</h3>
            <p>Professional exterior cleaning to restore your vehicle's shine.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Interior Detailing</h3>
            <p>Deep interior cleaning for a fresh and spotless finish.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Full Detail</h3>
            <p>Complete interior and exterior detailing for your vehicle.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Maintenance Wash</h3>
            <p>Keep your vehicle looking its best with regular professional care.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
