        services, bringing quality cleaning and attention to detail
        directly to you.
        <br><br>
        Our goal is simple: exceptional results, every time.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2 class="section-title">OUR WORK</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">The difference is in the details.</p>

    <div class="gallery">
        <div>YOUR WORK HERE</div>
        <div>YOUR WORK HERE</div>
        <div>YOUR WORK HERE</div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
    <h2 class="section-title">READY TO BOOK?</h2>
    <p>Give your vehicle the attention it deserves.</p>

    <a class="button" href="https://wa.me/353892504604">
        BOOK THROUGH WHATSAPP
    </a>

    <p>Phone: +353 89 250 4604</p>

    <p>
        Instagram:
        <a href="https://instagram.com/mu-detailing">
            @M/U-Detailing
        </a>
    </p>
</section>

<footer>
    © 2026 M/U-Detailing. All Rights Reserved.
    <br><br>
    PREMIUM MOBILE CAR DETAILING
</footer>

</body>
</html>
